This is an original MoonBit change-capture/projection implementation, not a port
of an existing CDC product. Third-party dependencies are downloaded by moon and
are not vendored or included in the production source line count:

- moonbit-community/sqlite3 0.2.3: Apache-2.0, according to package metadata.
  https://mooncakes.io/docs/moonbit-community/sqlite3
  Bundled SQLite 3.49.1 engine: public domain (SQLite upstream).
  https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html
- moonbitlang/async 0.22.4: Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/moonbitlang/async
- moonbitlang/x 0.5.5: Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/moonbitlang/x
- MoonBit core/toolchain: installed separately; its own upstream licenses apply.
  https://github.com/moonbitlang/core

Generated pkg.generated.mbti files are compiler output. Test data is synthetic.
The bounded CLI input pattern was adapted from the author's own MoonFixture
project (Apache-2.0): https://github.com/tlhuecdkoyg/MoonFixture
AI assistance was used for implementation and tests; the repository author
retains responsibility for validation and maintenance.
